==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/rɐˈsʲij.skʲɪj/|lang=ru}}
*{{audio|Ru-российский.ogg|audio}}

===Adjective===
'''росси́йский''' (rossíjskij) {{m}}

# [[Russian]] (concerning the country, nationality)

====Usage notes====
The word '''росси́йский''' emphasizes belonging to Russia, as a citizen or resident regardless of ethnicity, as opposed to {{term|ру́сский|lang=ru}}, which indicates ethnicity, etc. In some cases the words may be used interchangeably.

